<http://www.spektrix.com/kaymeekcentre/event/249002ALTSTNQRHGLCKDLNNRQMLVSKKGC> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "K25: After the Gold Rush Reimagined";
  schema:description """
	A celebration of Neil Young’s eclectic third album After the Gold Rush.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Our annual tradition of rounding up talented musicians to re-imagine a classic album continues! This edition of the popular two-night event features Krystle Dos Santos, Joe Henry, Rich Hope, Marcus Mosely, Samantha Parton, Marin Patenaude, Steve Poltz, Julian Taylor and others. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Expect to hear such timeless songs as Southern Man, Only Love Can Break Your Heart and the brilliant title track performed in styles entirely up to the artists’ inspiration. Following a first set of After the Gold Rush performed in its entirety, the second set will feature the guest artists’ choice of songs from Young’s extensive catalogue.
""";
